#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0324 expect=executionError domain=PC
#expect-execution-error "PCLLOQ is declared Char"
#note "R7 (PLAN-column-type-conformance): PCLLOQ shipped as Char is nonconformant data (SENDIG declares it Num). The migrated comparison num(PCORRES) < PCLLOQ reads PCLLOQ in a numeric order comparison, so per R4 the engine must ERROR rather than silently compare against a text limit."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset PC class=FINDINGS label="Pharmacokinetic Concentrations"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PCSEQ    type=Num
col PCTESTCD type=Char
col PCORRES  type=Char
col PCLLOQ   type=Char
col PCULOQ   type=Num
col PCSTRESC type=Char
---
S1 | PC | 001 | 1 | DRUGX | 2.5 | 5 | 100 | 2.5
